# Stable 42puzzles tokens (NRC's puzzle platform) — these don't expire like
# a login session does.
#
# How to get them:
#   1. Open https://www.nrc.nl/puzzels/crux/ while logged in and play/open
#      a Crux puzzle.
#   2. Open DevTools (F12) -> Network tab, and look at requests to
#      api.42puzzles.com — the query string / request body has both
#      playerId and userId.
#      (Alternative: Application/Storage -> Local Storage -> the
#      `oneplayer-userid` key holds the user id.)
NRC_PLAYER_ID=
NRC_USER_ID=
